{"id":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:1","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.passage","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Kojiki 1:1: The Origin of Heaven and Earth (天地初発)"}],"extensions":{"textual":{"container":"mw:work:shinto:kojiki","sequence":1,"unit":"section"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:shinto:kojiki:1:1:ja","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:1","language":"ja","script":"Jpan","representation":"source","text":"天地初発の時、高天原に成れる神の名は、天之御中主神。次に高御産巣日神。次に神産巣日神。此の三柱の神は、並独神と成り坐して、身を隠したまひき。"},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:shinto:kojiki:chamberlain-1882","provenance":"mw:provenance:shinto:kojiki:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:shinto:kojiki:1:1:en","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:1","language":"en","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"The names of the Deities that were born in the Plain of High Heaven when the Heaven and Earth began were the Deity Master-of-the-August-Center-of-Heaven, next the High-August-Producing-Wondrous Deity, next the Divine-Producing-Wondrous Deity. These three Deities were all Deities that were born alone, and hid their persons."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:shinto:kojiki:chamberlain-1882","provenance":"mw:provenance:shinto:kojiki:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:shinto:kojiki:1:1:id","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:1","language":"id","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"Pada saat pemisahan awal langit dan bumi, dewa pertama yang terlahir di Dataran Tinggi Surga adalah Ame-no-Minakanushi (Dewa Penguasa Pusat Surga), kemudian Takamimusubi, dan Kamimusubi. Ketiga dewa primordial ini lahir secara mandiri dan menyembunyikan wujud mereka."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:shinto:kojiki:chamberlain-1882","provenance":"mw:provenance:shinto:kojiki:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:2","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.passage","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Kojiki 1:2: The Birth of the Land and Seas (国生み)"}],"extensions":{"textual":{"container":"mw:work:shinto:kojiki","sequence":2,"unit":"section"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:shinto:kojiki:1:2:ja","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:2","language":"ja","script":"Jpan","representation":"source","text":"次に国稚く浮ける脂の如くして、水母なす漂へる時に、葦牙の如く萌え騰る物に因りて成れる神の名は、宇摩志阿斯訶備比古遅神。次に天之常立神。"},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:shinto:kojiki:chamberlain-1882","provenance":"mw:provenance:shinto:kojiki:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:shinto:kojiki:1:2:en","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:2","language":"en","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"Next, when the earth was young, like floating oil, and drifted about like a jellyfish, there was born from a thing that sprouted forth like a reed-shoot the Deity Pleasant-Reed-Shoot-Prince-Elder, next the Heavenly-Eternally-Standing Deity."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:shinto:kojiki:chamberlain-1882","provenance":"mw:provenance:shinto:kojiki:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:shinto:kojiki:1:2:id","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:2","language":"id","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"Ketika bumi masih muda, terapung seperti minyak di air dan mengapung laksana ubur-ubur, muncullah dari tunas yang tumbuh seperti pucuk alang-alang dewa Umashiashikabihikoji, kemudian dilanjutkan dengan terlahirnya dewa Amenotokotachi."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:shinto:kojiki:chamberlain-1882","provenance":"mw:provenance:shinto:kojiki:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:3","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.passage","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Kojiki 1:3: The Divine Mirror and Virtue of Purity (八咫鏡と清浄)"}],"extensions":{"textual":{"container":"mw:work:shinto:kojiki","sequence":3,"unit":"section"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:shinto:kojiki:1:3:ja","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:3","language":"ja","script":"Jpan","representation":"source","text":"八咫鏡を祭りて、常に心を清く保ち、正直を以て天下を治むべし。神道の本は清浄と正直にあり。"},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:shinto:kojiki:chamberlain-1882","provenance":"mw:provenance:shinto:kojiki:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:shinto:kojiki:1:3:en","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:3","language":"en","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"Enshrine the Sacred Mirror (Yata no Kagami), keep the heart forever pure, and govern the realm with uprightness and sincerity. The essence of Shinto lies in purity (Seimeishin) and honesty."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:shinto:kojiki:chamberlain-1882","provenance":"mw:provenance:shinto:kojiki:rec-2026"}}}
{"id":"mw:content:shinto:kojiki:1:3:id","record_type":"resource","kind":"textual.content","extensions":{"textual":{"target":"mw:passage:shinto:kojiki:1:3","language":"id","script":"Latn","representation":"source","text":"Peliharalah Cermin Suci (Yata no Kagami), jagalah hati agar senantiasa suci dan murni, serta pimpinlah dengan kejujuran dan ketulusan. Hakikat dari Shinto bersumber pada kesucian batin (Seimeishin) dan kejujuran nurani."},"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:shinto:kojiki:chamberlain-1882","provenance":"mw:provenance:shinto:kojiki:rec-2026"}}}
